WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:18.336
Toad was sitting by his boats.

2
00:00:18.337 --> 00:00:20.612
He looked up from a map.

3
00:00:20.613 --> 00:00:23.958
"Hooray!" cried Toad.

4
00:00:23.959 --> 00:00:28.478
He danced around Mole and Rat.

5
00:00:28.479 --> 00:00:32.960
"What are you up to now, Toad?" asked Rat.

6
00:00:32.961 --> 00:00:36.239
"How wonderful!" cried Toad.

7
00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.604
"Friends to travel with!"

8
00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:42.742
Rat looked a little worried.

9
00:00:42.743 --> 00:00:47.201
"You have a nice home," said Mole shyly.

10
00:00:47.202 --> 00:00:51.610
"Finest house on the whole river!" said Toad.

11
00:00:51.611 --> 00:00:55.007
"In the whole world!"

12
00:00:55.008 --> 00:00:57.918
Rat winked at Mole.

13
00:00:57.919 --> 00:01:01.670
"Toad is always saying that," said Rat.

14
00:01:01.671 --> 00:01:05.835
Toad giggled. "Oh, Ratty," he said.

15
00:01:05.836 --> 00:01:08.457
"That's just the way I am."

16
00:01:08.458 --> 00:01:11.473
Rat pointed to the pile of boats.

17
00:01:11.474 --> 00:01:14.416
"How is your boating going?"

18
00:01:14.417 --> 00:01:17.222
"Boating?" cried Toad.

19
00:01:17.223 --> 00:01:21.268
"Forget that! It's a waste of time!"

20
00:01:21.269 --> 00:01:23.748
"What?" Rat said.

21
00:01:23.749 --> 00:01:25.732
"Come with me, Rat.

22
00:01:25.733 --> 00:01:28.817
Bring your friend!" said Toad.

23
00:01:28.818 --> 00:01:32.270
They all walked to the stable.

24
00:01:32.271 --> 00:01:34.130
"There you are!"

25
00:01:34.131 --> 00:01:37.977
Toad pointed to a new yellow cart.

26
00:01:37.978 --> 00:01:39.952
"The open road!

27
00:01:39.953 --> 00:01:43.545
Travel and adventure!" cried Toad.

28
00:01:43.546 --> 00:01:48.281
"Harrumph!" Rat put his hands in his pockets.

29
00:01:48.282 --> 00:01:52.166
Mole stepped into the cart to look.

30
00:01:52.167 --> 00:01:56.691
His eyes opened wide with wonder.

31
00:01:56.692 --> 00:02:01.218
"I've got everything inside," said Toad.

32
00:02:01.219 --> 00:02:06.016
"Beds, a stove, pots and pans!

33
00:02:06.017 --> 00:02:09.535
All the food you can eat!"

34
00:02:09.536 --> 00:02:14.799
"There's even a bird in a cage!" said Mole.

35
00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:22.241
"We start our trip this afternoon!" shouted Toad.
